# ============================================================
#  Gamethon 8.0 — .gitignore
# ============================================================

# ─── Unreal Engine Installation (do NOT commit, 60GB+) ──────
/UE_5.6/
/UE_*/

# ─── Template/Prototype UE Projects (not our game) ──────────
"UE Projects/MyProject/"
"UE Projects/MyProject2/"

# ─── UE Project Build & Cache Directories ───────────────────
**/Intermediate/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Saved/
**/Binaries/
**/Build/
**/__ExternalActors__/
**/__ExternalObjects__/

# ─── UE Generated/IDE Files ─────────────────────────────────
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
*.aps
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# ─── Visual Studio / IDE ────────────────────────────────────
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/*.vcxproj*
**/.vscode/

# ─── Blender Temp / Autosave ────────────────────────────────
*.blend1
*.blend2
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# ─── Duplicate raw Environments folder (moved to Assets/) ───
/Environments/

# ─── System / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log

# ─── Packaging Output ───────────────────────────────────────
**/Package/
**/PackagedBuilds/
